### RF-1 — monthly expenses for 2026-07
### Expect rows: "P7 Groceries" 5000, "P7 Rent" 30000, "P7 Snacks" 2000, "P7 Shared Dining" 9000
### (both shared expenses debit their holder share to the same bucket: 5000 + 4000), and — RF-1 LEAK —
