### Health — OutboxHealthCheck behind GET /health, JSON via HealthCheckResponseWriterHelper
GET {{api_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

# HTTP/2 200
# content-type: application/json
# cache-control: no-store, no-cache
# {"status":"Healthy","totalDurationMs":2.327,"checks":[{"name":"outbox","status":"Healthy","description":"Outbox is clear.","data":{}}]}

###

### RNF-7 health degradation — closes the deferred Phase 6 DoD item
#
# OutboxHealthCheck (src/Shared/PersonalFinance.Infrastructure/Outbox/OutboxHealthCheck.cs):
#   pending == 0                          → Healthy   (HTTP 200)  "Outbox is clear."
#   pending > 0, age <= StalenessThreshold → Degraded (HTTP 200)
#   pending > 0, age >  StalenessThreshold → Unhealthy (HTTP 503)
#   age = TimeProvider.System.GetUtcNow() - (oldest pending row's OccurredOnUtc)
# OutboxOptions.StalenessThreshold default = 5 minutes (config section "Outbox" unset → default).
# There is ONE threshold; 5 min of age on the oldest unprocessed row is the Degraded↔Unhealthy line.
# Backlog source per module: <module>_outbox_messages, pending = `ProcessedOnUtc IS NULL`,
# age anchor = `OccurredOnUtc` of the lowest-Id pending row. No response cache — the check
# re-runs on every GET /health with a fresh DI scope, so no wait is needed between observations.
#
# Manual run 2026-09-01 (host on the `https` profile; DB = personalfinance.db at the solution root).
# Full transcript + exact SQL:
#   /tmp/claude-1000/-home-ipoch-Documents-PersonalFinanceApp-app-api/98e7d405-4489-48b1-9216-b928d807e946/scratchpad/rnf7-proof.md
#
# 1) host stopped — inject one pending row, OccurredOnUtc ~45 s old (inside the 5-min window):
#    sqlite3 personalfinance.db "INSERT INTO financing_outbox_messages
#      (MessageId, Type, Payload, OccurredOnUtc, ProcessedOnUtc, Attempts, Error)
#      VALUES ('68FB1888-2AD9-4A0E-8C05-8BC5E4EDB260',
#              'RNF7.Injected.Unresolvable, RNF7.FakeAssembly', '{}',
#              '2026-09-01 16:35:40.441701+00:00', NULL, 0, NULL);"
#
# 2) start host → GET /health → DEGRADED / 200:
#    HTTP/2 200
#    {"status":"Degraded","totalDurationMs":13.4356,"checks":[{"name":"outbox","status":"Degraded","description":"Outbox backlog: 1 pending, oldest 57s old.","data":{"pending":1,"oldestAgeSeconds":56.8817827}}]}
#
# 3) stop host — backdate the same row past 5 min (~15 min old):
#    sqlite3 personalfinance.db "UPDATE financing_outbox_messages
#      SET OccurredOnUtc='2026-09-01 16:22:02.272482+00:00', Attempts=0, Error=NULL
#      WHERE MessageId='68FB1888-2AD9-4A0E-8C05-8BC5E4EDB260';"
#
# 4) start host → GET /health → UNHEALTHY / 503:
#    HTTP/2 503
#    {"status":"Unhealthy","totalDurationMs":19.0953,"checks":[{"name":"outbox","status":"Unhealthy","description":"Outbox backlog stale: 1 pending, oldest 910s old.","data":{"pending":1,"oldestAgeSeconds":910.3290182}}]}
#
# 5) cleanup — stop host, delete the injected row, restart → GET /health → HEALTHY / 200:
#    sqlite3 personalfinance.db "DELETE FROM financing_outbox_messages
#      WHERE MessageId='68FB1888-2AD9-4A0E-8C05-8BC5E4EDB260';"
#    HTTP/2 200
#    {"status":"Healthy","totalDurationMs":8.1453,"checks":[{"name":"outbox","status":"Healthy","description":"Outbox is clear.","data":{}}]}
#
# financing_outbox_messages restored to its original 3 rows (all ProcessedOnUtc set);
# PRAGMA integrity_check = ok; all four *_outbox_messages tables report 0 pending. DB left Healthy.

