# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Phase 10 — D12 / D13 re-verification (post RF-1 + RF-2 fixes)
#
# Manual E2E run 2026-09-02 against the `https` launch profile (https://localhost:7095,
# self-signed cert, driven with `curl -sk`). Fresh personalfinance.db: deleted, then
# `dotnet ef database update` for Ledger (incl. the two new migrations
# LedgerMonthlyExpensesExcludeCardPurchases + AccountOwnerReference), Financing,
# Subscriptions, Parties. Every `#` line below a request is the REAL observed
# status + body / SQL result from that run.
#
# Confirms after the Phase 10 changes:
#   • D13  POST /v1/instruments still routes debit/cash → Ledger, credit → Financing,
#          and each provisioned card Ledger account now carries OwnerReferenceId = the
#          Financing CardId (RF-2 seam).
#   • RF-1 the per-card "<name> Purchases" account is now AccountKind.CardPurchases.
#   • D12  a paid installment's reversal still posts the compensating entry
#          Dr <card> Credit / Cr <card> Liability  (NOT Cr Gasto:Categoría — this is
#          the DESIGN.md D12 worked-example doc-sync proof), the Parties split is
#          corrected (metadata only), and the carried credit nets the next statement.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ---- D13. POST /v1/instruments routing ------------------------------------------

