### Split payment plan — 300000 over 3 installments, purchase 2026-02-05 (long-closed),
### holder implicit + Alice 1 + Bob 1. Writes one financing_outbox_messages row (D8).
POST {{financing}}/payment-plans
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amountMinorUnits": 300000,
  "cardId": "01a05fcf-879a-7c9d-8ccc-32d2332fa203",
  "installmentCount": 3,
  "purchaseDate": "2026-02-05",
  "split": [
    { "partyId": "01a05fcf-8779-748a-8b0e-1a1f8dc10497", "weight": 1 },
    { "partyId": "01a05fcf-878e-789c-a1d7-0aeeedcd3ccb", "weight": 1 }
  ]
}

# HTTP/2 201  {"paymentPlanId":"01a05fcf-a721-7932-b88d-98ad34bc8738"}
#
# After the OutboxWorker drains (~2 s) OnPaymentPlanCreated has recorded the split intent
# (AccruedReceivable = 0 — not owed at plan creation, D11) and linked the receivable accounts:
#   sqlite3 personalfinance.db "SELECT Source, TotalMinorUnits, HolderShareMinorUnits, AccruedReceivableMinorUnits
#     FROM parties_expense_splits WHERE SourceReferenceId='01A05FCF-A721-7932-B88D-98AD34BC8738' COLLATE NOCASE;"
#   CardPlan | 300000 | 100000 | 0        (later 199998 once all 3 cycles accrue: 2×33333×3)
#
# AccrueInstallments (interval 1 min, also on startup) then posts each closed cycle, tagged
# InstallmentReferenceId + SplitReferenceId. One cycle's legs (100000 / 3, odd cent to holder):
#   Dr D12 Card Purchases  33334   (Kind = CardPurchases — RF-1)
#   Dr D12 Alice Receivable 33333
#   Dr D12 Bob Receivable   33333
#       Cr D12 Card Liability      100000
# Three statements roll up, one per cycle (2026-2, 2026-3, 2026-4), AmountDue 100000 each.

### Alice's balance after all 3 cycles accrued — live read of her Receivable
GET {{parties}}/01a05fcf-8779-748a-8b0e-1a1f8dc10497/balance

# HTTP/2 200  {"partyId":"01a05fcf-8779-748a-8b0e-1a1f8dc10497","name":"D12 Alice","balanceMinorUnits":99999}
#   (33333 × 3 cycles)

### Pay the 2026-02 statement (AmountDue 100000) — plain cash payment, no carried credit yet
POST {{financing}}/statements/01A05FCF-EB65-7A6A-B77C-DEF3250C997A/pay
Content-Type: application/json

{ "bankAccountId": "01a05fcf-876a-703b-afa9-f0bed388e8a7", "paidOnUtc": "2026-08-31T10:00:00Z" }

# HTTP/2 201  {"statementId":"01a05fcf-eb65-7a6a-b77c-def3250c997a"}
#   pay txn legs:  Dr D12 Card Liability 100000 / Cr D12 Funding 100000

### Reverse cycle-2's accrual transaction — the installment was PAID
POST {{ledger}}/transactions/01A05FCF-EB73-7BEC-A2B0-CCDF395564D6/reversal

# HTTP/2 201
# {"reversalTransactionId":"01a05fd2-3bf8-7cb9-8ed5-1b4535a29910","originalTransactionId":"01a05fcf-eb73-7bec-a2b0-ccdf395564d6","compensatingEntryPosted":true}
#
# 1) Storno — exact mirror of the original accrual (append-only, original row untouched):
#      Dr D12 Card Liability 100000 / Cr D12 Card Purchases 33334 / Cr D12 Alice Receivable 33333 / Cr D12 Bob Receivable 33333
# 2) Compensating entry (D12 worked example — matches DESIGN.md AFTER the Step 7 doc-sync):
#      Dr D12 Card Credit 100000
#          Cr D12 Card Liability 100000       <-- NOT Cr Gasto:Categoría; the storno already unwound the expense
#    sqlite3 personalfinance.db "SELECT CarriedCreditBalanceMinorUnits FROM financing_credit_cards WHERE Name='D12 Card';"  -- 100000
# 3) Installment seq 1 flagged reversed (2 & 3 untouched):
#    sqlite3 personalfinance.db "SELECT Sequence, IsReversed FROM financing_installments
#      WHERE PaymentPlanId='01A05FCF-A721-7932-B88D-98AD34BC8738' COLLATE NOCASE ORDER BY Sequence;"  -- 1|1  2|0  3|0
# 4) Parties cascade — metadata only, NO ledger post (RNF-5, the storno's Cr Receivable legs already
#    dropped the balances):
#    sqlite3 personalfinance.db "SELECT AccruedReceivableMinorUnits, ReversedReceivableMinorUnits
#      FROM parties_expense_splits WHERE SourceReferenceId='01A05FCF-A721-7932-B88D-98AD34BC8738' COLLATE NOCASE;"  -- 199998 | 66666

